"wikipedia.org/wiki/Digital_Chart_of_the_World>`__. Append one or more comma-"
"separated countries using the 2-letter `ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 convention "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_3166-1_alpha-2>`__. To select a state of "
"a country (if available), append .\\ *state*, (e.g, ``\"US.TX\"`` for "
"Texas). To specify a whole continent, prepend **=** to any of the continent "
"codes (e.g. ``\"=EU\"`` for Europe). Append **+p**\\ *pen* to draw polygon "
"outlines [Default is no outline] and **+g**\\ *fill* to fill them [Default "
"is no fill]."
msgstr ""

